        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for Bike Transportation In Brajrajnagar, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Full transit insurance is mandatory and provided at 100 % declared value under an IRDAI‑approved policy. It covers accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities during the entire transit. The insurance premium is itemised in the quote, and any claim is processed swiftly with minimal paperwork, ensuring your bike’s financial safety.</p>
