        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp trailer differ from standard bike parcel services like bus or train shipments?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramp trailers are purpose‑built for two‑wheelers, featuring a motorised ramp that aligns perfectly with the bike’s wheelbase, eliminating manual lifting. Unlike bus or train parcels that expose bikes to vibration and limited securing options, our trailers provide enclosed, climate‑controlled containers, custom cradles, and multi‑point lashing, guaranteeing a smoother, scratch‑free ride.</p>
