 declared value under an IRDAI‑approved policy. It covers accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities during the entire transit. The insurance premium is itemised in the quote, and any claim is processed swiftly with minimal paperwork, ensuring your bike’s financial safety."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the hydraulic ramp trailer differ from standard bike parcel services like bus or train shipments?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Hydraulic ramp trailers are purpose‑built for two‑wheelers, featuring a motorised ramp that aligns perfectly with the bike’s wheelbase, eliminating manual lifting. Unlike bus or train parcels that expose bikes to vibration and limited securing options, our trailers provide enclosed, climate‑controlled containers, custom cradles, and multi‑point lashing, guaranteeing a smoother, scratch‑free ride."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the typical timings for bike parcel delivery from Brajrajnagar to major hubs?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Standard Bike Transportation In Brajrajnagar follows a 2‑3 day transit window for the 850 km route, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Express options are available for an additional fee, reducing delivery to 24‑36 hours. All timings are communicated at booking, and real‑time GPS updates keep you informed of any deviations."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer any special handling for high‑value or custom bikes during transportation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. For high‑value or custom motorcycles, we provide bespoke wooden crates, additional foam padding, and a dedicated handling crew trained in premium bike care. These services are reflected in the itemised quote and are covered under the same 100 % insured value, ensuring your prized bike receives the utmost protection throughout the journey."}}]}
